From: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:18:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/17] invariant: all ten vetoes, and a veto that cannot be
 evaluated fails

One function per SUBSTRATE section 10 veto, thresholds from params/vetoes.yaml
and no number in the package. apply_vetoes records every verdict and returns
the first failure in the configured order; a veto that raises is recorded as a
failure. Missing input fails closed: fail-open would put an unmeasured run on
the leaderboard.
